    "norm": "Builds a compact string token for an element to record which elements were visited and in what order. Format per element: {@code tagName[#id][ownText][+];} <ul> <li>{@code tagName} — the element's tag, e.g. {@code head}, {@code a}, {@code #root}</li> <li>{@code #id} — appended only when the element carries an {@code id} attribute</li> <li>{@code [text]} — appended only when the element has non-empty own text</li> <li>{@code +} — appended when the element has a next element sibling</li> <li>{@code ;} — always appended as a delimiter</li> </ul>"
   },
