    "norm": "Expected visit order for a minimal HTML document containing a single {@code <a>} element. Elements are emitted bottom-up (children before parents) as each element is closed: {@code head} (with next sibling) → {@code a[Link]} → {@code body} → {@code html} → {@code #root}"
